DE:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hey!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Gehste immer noch hier einkaufen?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ich? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich hatte hier in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
was zu erledigen, also dacht ich, ich
seh mir die alte Heimat noch mal an!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Selam!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Alışverişi hâlâ burada mı yapıyorsun?

{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Ben mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'da birkaç işim vardı;
eski günlerin hatırına dükkânlara da
bir göz atayım dedim!
